The method follows this sequence:

**a) Parse and locate the storage location** (lines 555-565)
```
Parse location string (warehouse, floor, tier, rick, position)
↓
Find the actual StorageLocation database record
```

**b) Check location availability BEFORE finding barrel** (lines 570-607)
