The system prevents **two types of conflicts**:

| Conflict Type | Prevention Mechanism | Level | When Checked |
|---|---|---|---|
| Multiple barrels in **storage location** | `locationId @unique` DB constraint | Database | After INSERT/UPDATE (atomic) |
| Barrel with **both location types** | `BarrelLocationConflictException` | Application | Before INSERT/UPDATE (fail-fast) |
