## Q58: Purpose of Bulk Operation Status Tracking

**Purpose**: Bulk operation status tracking enables the system to handle large-scale barrel operations with resilient error handling and partial success scenarios. Rather than failing entirely on the first error, the system processes all valid items while accumulating detailed per-item error information.

