   - **Tier strength** (25%): % of barrels in entire rick A
   - **Consecutive strength** (10%): Unbroken chains (e.g., if lot A has positions 8,9,10,11, score is 100%)
   - **Edge bonus** (5%): If barrels exist at positions 1 or 21 in adjacent tiers
