The WHK-WMS application implements **multi-layer rate limiting** with different tiers for different operation types, combining both backend (NestJS) throttling and frontend API proxy limiting. The system uses graduated limits based on request intensity and operation impact.

### **Backend Global Rate Limiting (3 Tiers)**

The backend configures three throttle tiers in a single global guard (apps/whk-wms/src/app.module.ts:140-163):

```
