      locationString: locationString,
      eventType: data?.eventType || "Entry",
      operator: data?.operator || "system",
      deviceName: deviceName || data?.inboxDeviceName || "Not Available @ENT",
      originalPayload: { ...data },
      inboxDeviceName: deviceName || data?.inboxDeviceName,
      inboxId: data?.inboxId,
    },
  };

  const exception = new BadRequestException(
    `The same Barrel is already stored at this location: ${locationString}`,
  );
  (exception as any).errorToLog = errorToLog;
  throw exception;
```

**Flag evaluation context:**
- `kind: "device"`: Reentry mode is evaluated per-device (scanner identifier)
- `key: deviceName`: The device making the scan
- `barrelSN`, `locationString`: Contextual information for targeting rules

