    transactionClient,
    barrelSN,
    data,
    eventTypeName,
    locationString,
  );
```

**Performance optimization:**
- In **permissive mode**, just log the reentry event (idempotent)
- In **strict mode**, full barrel creation logic proceeds to catalog any data differences

