When finding lot variations to resolve canonical lot IDs, the service **explicitly avoids the transaction** (`this.prisma` not `tx`). This prevents SSI predicate locks on the LotVariation table that would delay concurrent barrel entries. Lot variations are treated as reference data that changes infrequently, so reading outside the transaction is safe.

