### **Error Handling Flow**

```
Device Sync Request
     ↓
[Stage 1: Validation]
   ├─ Format validation → ErrorCategory.VALIDATION
   ├─ Reference validation → ErrorCategory.REFERENCE
   └─ Business rule validation → ErrorCategory.BUSINESS_RULE
     ↓
[Stage 2: Error Type Classification]
   ├─ Pattern matching → errorType (e.g., "BadQrScan:RequiresEandTIntervention")
   ├─ Context evaluation → errorLevel (CRITICAL/ERROR/WARN/INFO)
