The system enforces **two-tier validation**:

| Tier | Validation | Location | Action if Invalid |
|------|-----------|----------|-------------------|
| **Tier 1: Input** | repairReason field must exist | `validateInspectionPayload()` line 2806 | Throw BadRequestException |
| **Tier 2: Master Data** | repairReason must match EventReason.name (if inspection failed) | `processInspectionResult()` line 2862 | Throw NotFoundException, roll back transaction |

This prevents orphaned EventReason references and ensures data integrity.

