### **Concurrency Summary Table**

| Scenario | Detection Point | Action | User Feedback |
|----------|-----------------|--------|----------------|
| **Same error, concurrent user** | Layer 1 (status check) | Reject entire batch | BadRequestException with error IDs |
| **Partial batch already resolved** | Layer 1 (status check) | Reject entire batch | Lists which errors already RESOLVED |
| **Business logic fails mid-batch** | Layer 3 (catch block) | Continue but rollback all | Detailed categorized error report |
| **Concurrent write wins race** | Layer 4 (post-verify) | Logs discrepancy | Error log with mismatch details |

