```

**Ratio**: 10x difference (10 vs 100)

---

### Purpose and Usage Comparison

| Aspect | resource-monitor.service.ts | queue-health.service.ts |
|--------|---------------------------|----------------------|
| **Value** | 10 | 100 |
| **Purpose** | Resource constraint enforcement | Health status reporting |
| **Used For** | Determining system overload | Reporting queue health |
| **Function** | `canQueueNewJob()` (disabled) | `getOverallHealth()` |
| **Philosophy** | Conservative/cautious | Permissive/tolerant |

